; OBJETOS - overlay like PAUSA: box cols 1-18, rows 1-10. Title at col 3 row 2.
; List rows 4-8: only the owned entries, packed from row 4 in this order: POCION (if potions > 0),
; LLAVE (if keys > 0), DAGA (always), BACULO (if weapon owned), AMULETO (if amulet).
; Names at col 4 (SCREEN_OBJETOS_AT_POCION column), marker cols 15-16 (SCREEN_OBJETOS_AT_X3
; column): "X<n>" for counts, "EQ" on the equipped weapon and on the amulet. Cursor col 3.
tilesets: ui font font_lower
legend:
# AM_WALL
+ AM_UP
, AM_FLOOR
& ICON_HP
^ ICON_STAFF
$ ICON_AMULET
[ ICON_KEY
] ICON_POTION
@ ICON_COMPASS
/ DASH
: COLON
< FRAME_TL
_ FRAME_T
> FRAME_TR
{ FRAME_L
} FRAME_R
( FRAME_BL
= FRAME_B
) FRAME_BR
* CURSOR
grid:
####,,,,,,,,,,,,####
#<________________>#
#{.Objetos........}#
#{................}#
#{.*Pocion.....x3.}#
#{..Llave......x1.}#
#{..Daga..........}#
#{..Baculo.....EQ.}#
#{..Amuleto....EQ.}#
#{................}#
#(================)#
####,,,,,,,,,,,,####
.&18/20.^$.[1.]3.@N.
....................
.Piso 1.............
.Abres la puerta....
.Golpe: 3...........
.Diablillo cae......
sprites:
